     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Paul<div><br></div><div>I solved a problem that I mentioned before, where setNodePosition() returned an error. The trick is to set return.graph=TRUE, as shown below.</div><div><br></div><div>Best wishes,</div><div><br></div><div>Mark</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(100,56,32)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span># Example for Paul</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>g = makeSimpleGraph ()</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>win &lt;- CytoscapeWindow(<span style=\"color:#c41a16\">&quot;Orignial&quot;</span>, g)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>displayGraph(win)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>setNodePosition (win, c (<span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">&#39;A&#39;</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">&#39;B&#39;</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">&#39;C&#39;</span>), c (<span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">10.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">20.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">500</span>), c (<span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">0.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">100.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">3</span>))</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>fitContent(win)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>selectNodes(win, getAllNodes(win))</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>newwin &lt;- createWindowFromSelection(win, <span style=\"color:#c41a16\">&quot;New Window&quot;</span>, return.graph=FALSE)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>setNodePosition (newwin, c (<span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">&#39;A&#39;</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">&#39;B&#39;</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">&#39;C&#39;</span>), c (<span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">10.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">20.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">500</span>), c (<span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">0.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">100.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">3</span>))</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(100,56,32)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></span>#  Error!  unknown nodes in RCytoscape::setNodePosition</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(100,56,32)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></span>#       A</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(100,56,32)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></span>#       B</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(100,56,32)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></span>#       C</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(100,56,32)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></span>#  NULL</div></div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>deleteWindow(cy, window.title=<span style=\"color:#c41a16\">&quot;New Window&quot;</span>)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>newwin &lt;- createWindowFromSelection(win, <span style=\"color:#c41a16\">&quot;New Window&quot;</span>, return.graph=TRUE)</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>setNodePosition (newwin, c (<span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">&#39;A&#39;</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">&#39;B&#39;</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">&#39;C&#39;</span>), c (<span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">10.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">20.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">500</span>), c (<span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">0.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">100.0</span>, <span style=\"color:#1c00cf\">3</span>))</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#643820\">#</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 10px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(100,56,32)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t</span></span>#  Now Works!</div></div><div></div></div>"
